        "description": "Second-stage C++ infostealer of the fake TV-episode torrent campaign (C2 beenetprotect.com, YouTube/GitHub Gist dead drops; Thereallo, Oct 2026). Decrypted from the loader's ChaCha20 overlay. Hard-coded YouTube consent cookie used for dead-drop requests, Chromium profile lock-file names and browser User Data paths, CRT-only import table, bundled zlib 1.3.1.2-audit, and a dense byte-argument call idiom (likely its string-protection call sites). Built from one build; matches the decrypted in-memory payload, not the padded loader on disk.",
