        "twitter_handle": null,
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Stage 2 infostealer, decrypted statically (ChaCha20, key = footer[0:32] ^ .data[0:32], counter 0) from the loader f64c72efbc83a0854d3ad4138cc2b94d88ea628becf6e950f7c1854cac1358f4. Compiled 2026-10-22 17:37:21 UTC, 48 s before its loader. Delivered via LimeTorrents as 'VisionQuest S01E05 Firewall 1080p WEB H264-FLUX 7z' and 'South Park S29E04 1080p WEB H264-CAKES 7z' (same 875 MB archive, sha256 eb9d7b0b9c474428f82a100d330d1fc01f6902ed6c90d20e707ad5769e48f751), containing 'Abbott Elementary S06E04 Halloween Party 1080p WEB H264-FLUX.exe' (912,764,314 B, sha256 f64c72efbc83a0854d3ad4138cc2b94d88ea628becf6e950f7c1854cac1358f4). Matches YARA FakeTorrent_Stealer_Win64 (browser User Data paths, Singleton* locks, YouTube consent cookie for dead-drop fetch). Previous build: 9933977b38adbe73cc852ffca785c4111b7922de7e515801ec8411e9e25708ce. C2 per ThreatFox: beenetprotect.com. Loader: 2e546d8cee635b86e389b3d4430cefadaf7db1c9116487e480fea06badb30ea7. Format per https://thereallo.dev/blog/someone-on-torrent-sites-kept-fucking-with-my-sonarr-setup"
      }
